Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanIntersectionScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Multiple billboards may distract drivers" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

:billboard1 a :Billboard .
:billboard2 a :Billboard .
:trafficLight1 a :TrafficLight .
:trafficSign1 a :TrafficSign .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:billboard2 a :Billboard ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle2 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject .
:obstacle2 a :RoadObject .
```

